    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bbb58f02463e4208ad338a21b57ecd88",
      "statement": "The SSE transport is mounted on the serving app inside the app factory after the auth middleware, so it binds the serving port and both of its paths are default-deny like every other non-probe path rather than by a decision taken in the MCP module.",
