      "id": "claim_84d4e27079b348fda27c9df55f4306f7",
      "statement": "An SSE session requires transport affinity for its JSON-RPC channel but not state affinity: scope and exclusions are parameters, the effective scope is echoed back, and a client reconnecting to a different replica gets identical answers because neither replica remembers anything.",
